    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The machines came early\u2014built by man, perfected by themselves, and then they cut us out. CortexSync, the company that gave them minds, lost control... or maybe handed it over. Now they run the networks, the signals, the street and everything else built by humans. You\u2019re a shadow in their building, one of the last with a pulse. To survive and destroy them, you take heads\u2014quiet, clean. Pull the trigger or knife and you might survive\u2014but a burned body gives you nothing, so aim with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to destroy the satellite that keeps CortexSync\u2019s AI grid online. Each floor is locked tight, guarded by machine shells wearing human faces. The only way up is through them. Take their heads, clone the chip, unlock the elevator. But be warned: if you destroy the body, the chip is lost\u2014choose your weapon wisely. Use the knife for a clean kill, or aim for the head if you need to shoot. Floor by floor, enemy by enemy. Reach the top, destroy the signal, and shut them down\u2014for good.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the satellite on each level by shooting, headshotting or knifing the enemies and collecting their elevator access codes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713550/extras/767c61e70e428cf387b2051a01cd0e34.avif?t=1755687165\" width=300 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the satellite on each level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713550/extras/b15a949770fcb58263140cd36013629b.avif?t=1755687165\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, headshot or knife the enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713550/extras/5e8948ed8a905cace98564ce4ae612fd.avif?t=1755687165\" width=300 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the enemy elevator access codes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713550/extras/43b57975d58985a488ddc2981ff70c65.avif?t=1755687165\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access codes can only be collected from enemy bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713550/extras/34d50b3c73be3d467dd293b2d550874b.avif?t=1755687165\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use headshot or knife to keep the enemy body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Near future plans</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > demo\u00a0release for Steam Next Fest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a lot more levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >per-level challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >better game progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Far future plans</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >level editor with workshop integration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
