s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713550/extras/5e8948ed8a905cace98564ce4ae612fd.avif?t=1755687165\" width=300 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the enemy elevator access codes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713550/extras/43b57975d58985a488ddc2981ff70c65.avif?t=1755687165\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access codes can only be collected from enemy bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713550/extras/34d50b3c73be3d467dd293b2d550874b.avif?t=1755687165\" width=300 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use headshot or knife to keep the enemy body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Near future plans</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > demo\u00a0release for Steam Next Fest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a lot more levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >per-level challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >better game progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Far future plans</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >level editor with workshop integration</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
